ose the data base file andexit._________________________________   1See section 1.2 for GUI definations.                                        13  14                         CHAPTER 3.  SEARCHING A DATA BASE.               Figure 3.1: Main command menu of Librarian.   _____________________________________________________________________________   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                       Main Command Menu                                   |   |                                                                           |   | Quit                                                                      |   | List Cards                                                                |   | List Titles                                                               |   | List Authors                                                              |   | List Subjects                                                             |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |                                                                           |   |   